# densNet — Global Rules

## Project
- Dental radiography **3-class** classifier: `dentin`, `enamel`, `pulp`
- Backbone: **DenseNet121** (PyTorch / torchvision)
- Checkpoints live under `slm/` (small language/vision model weights for this repo)
- Default inference checkpoint: `slm/resolution_best_densenet_model.pth`

## Class Order (do not reorder)
```python
CLASS_NAMES = ["dentin", "enamel", "pulp"]  # 0, 1, 2
```

## Modular & Pythonic
- Prefer **small, single-purpose functions/modules** over long monolithic scripts
- Keep import-safe modules: definitions at top level; side effects only under `if __name__ == "__main__":` / `main()`
- Shared logic lives in the **`densnet/`** package (device, constants, transforms, model load, predict, detect, metrics, dataset, train)
- **`main.py` is the only CLI** — do not add parallel root scripts for train/predict/detect/evaluate
- Idiomatic Python 3.10+: type hints, `pathlib` for new path logic, explicit names, no `import *`
- Prefer clear data flow (`load → transform → predict → write`) over deep nesting or god objects

## Package (`densnet/`)
| Module | Role |
|--------|------|
| `constants.py` | `CLASS_NAMES`, colors, default checkpoint, paths |
| `device.py` | CUDA → MPS → CPU |
| `transforms.py` | train / eval ImageNet transforms |
| `model.py` | create / load DenseNet121 |
| `dataset.py` | `DentalRadiographyDataset` |
| `predict_batch.py` | folder → CSV predictions |
| `detect.py` | sliding-window detection |
| `metrics.py` | Precision / Recall / Accuracy / F1 |
| `train_loop.py` | `train_epoch` / `validate` |
| `train_runner.py` | full train → test → plots pipeline |

## CLI
```bash
python main.py --help
python main.py --train
python main.py --predict all|dentin|enamel|pulp
python main.py --evaluate
python main.py --detect [--image PATH]
```

## Device Selection
Always prefer: CUDA → MPS → CPU (same pattern as existing scripts).

## Do Not
- Do not add FastAPI / web API scaffolding unless explicitly requested
- Do not commit large binaries: `*.pth`, `pip_packages/`, datasets, raw images
- Do not invent new class labels or change class index order
- Do not replace DenseNet121 without an explicit request
- Do not dump unrelated helpers into one mega-file; keep modules cohesive
- Do not recreate removed root scripts (`train.py`, `detect_simple.py`, `predict_*_test.py`, `evaluate_test_predictions.py`)

## Output Locations
- Predictions: `test_predictions/`
- External test images: `image-testing/{dentin,enamel,pulp}_test/`
- Training data: `segmented_dental_adiography/{train,valid,test}/`
